# tdscnt.ref - Expected dispatch aggregate counts for PROGRAM TDSCNT
#
# Source of truth: FROZEN mis/xsem00.f dispatch ladder (read-only).
# The modern validator modern/dispatch/dispval.f must reproduce the
# catalogued MODX counts: entry count == catalog count, with zero
# duplicate codes and zero unmapped codes.
#
# Key/value lines (machine-readable). The driver tdscnt.f hardcodes
# the primary expected values and may also consult this file; values
# here MUST agree with the driver.
#
EXPECT_TOTAL 217
EXPECT_CALL 193
EXPECT_DISTINCT 188
EXPECT_RESERVED 21
EXPECT_FATAL 3
EXPECT_DUP 0
EXPECT_UNMAPPED 0
RANGE_LOW 1
RANGE_HIGH 217
#
# Notes:
#  - CALL=193 dispatched slots resolve to DISTINCT=188 subroutines
#    because XCEI is shared by 6 MODX values (5,6,7,11,12,13).
#  - RESERVED=21 are reserved no-op CONTINUE slots (no module call).
#  - FATAL=3 are in-range slots MODX 1,2,4 (fall through to GO TO 940).
#  - 193 + 21 + 3 = 217 = TOTAL.
#
# EXPECT_VERDICT PASS: TDSCNT
